# Allowlist, not denylist: the checkout carries gigabytes of untracked
# build outputs, browser profiles and sweep results (zig-out*, .pinned/,
# .chrome-*, results/, tools/fingerprint/ ...) and new ones appear all the
# time. Only what service/Dockerfile actually builds from is sent.
*
!build.zig
!build.zig.zon
!deps/
!orderfile/
!src/
!service/
# The V8 version/tag the build pins (shared with `make download-v8` and CI).
!.github/actions/install/action.yml

# Host build products that must be regenerated for the image's platform:
# snapshot.bin is architecture specific and the Rust target dir is the
# host's (macOS) objects.
src/snapshot.bin
src/rust/target/
**/.zig-cache/
**/zig-out/
**/node_modules/
